/-- **Restricted Weil Ground Energy Floor Past `½ log 2`:**
`1 / 5000 ≤ ccmRestrictedWeilGroundEnergy A` for every positive aperture `A ≤ 181 / 500`. -/
theorem one_div_5000_le_ccmRestrictedWeilGroundEnergy_threeHundredSixtyTwoThousandths
    {A : SuzukiPositiveAperture} (hA : A.1 ≤ 181 / 500) :
